<title>USA: Vivax Medical chairman resigns.</title>
<headline>Vivax Medical chairman resigns.</headline>
<dateline>BRISTOL, Conn. 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vivax Medical Corp said Monday that Paul DiMatteo, founder of the company, has submitted his resignation as chairman, for personal reasons.</p>
<p>Vivax said DiMatteo will continue to be a director in charge of research and development at the company's manufacturing facility in Brentwood, N.Y.</p>
<p>Stephen Fisher, president of Vivax, will replace DiMatteo and has been formally elected to the additional position of chairman, the company said.</p>
